Plan consistency check
No implementation code, database migration, permission backfill, branch configuration, or deployment was changed by creating this plan.
The plan does not create a second global location switch. It consolidates branch discovery and branch viewing inside Shift while keeping operating context explicit.
Every mutation path remains server-authorized by tenant, permission, location grant, terminal, shift ownership, operator scope, and strict-device policy.
The plan preserves existing shift, parked-sale, cart, drawer, and operator ownership rather than introducing a viewer-owned financial state.
The plan does not claim the feature is execution-ready until permission-catalog and phase-ledger inconsistencies are reconciled.
